    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/8f9bc4f07e32f3e0efc21801bd986e13.poster.avif?t=1755116851\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/8f9bc4f07e32f3e0efc21801bd986e13.webm?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/8f9bc4f07e32f3e0efc21801bd986e13.mp4?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure Drawing Garden is an immersive virtual garden designed to help you practice and improve at figure drawing \u2014 an essential skill for any artist which trains the ability to capture gesture, anatomy, weight, balance, tension, and emotion. So\u00a0grab your sketchbook, relax, explore, and draw in your very own Figure Drawing Garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/74fc98883cdc2e463248f273ba24d8f4.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=68 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exquisite collection of 3D-scanned classical and renaissance sculptures to draw \u2014 curated to provide accurate anatomy, dynamic poses, and a variety of body types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/59ebc82e29e7093bb4ed74bcb52d5c6a.poster.avif?t=1755116851\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/59ebc82e29e7093bb4ed74bcb52d5c6a.webm?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/59ebc82e29e7093bb4ed74bcb52d5c6a.mp4?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/2e510d4c26abe9f287ff5f326ba8af3a.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=68 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your own infinite virtual garden of towering monuments, intricate fountains, and quiet courtyards \u2014 which expands as you draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/fdecbf598bd45f605fa97dd7985f2abe.poster.avif?t=1755116851\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/fdecbf598bd45f605fa97dd7985f2abe.webm?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/fdecbf598bd45f605fa97dd7985f2abe.mp4?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/05239d6bfb95d251867f580a903403af.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practicing your shading?\u00a0Enter <i>Dynamic Lighting</i> mode and light the figure as you desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/b03869295f9f7d3e0e471807fcc6bfd2.poster.avif?t=1755116851\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/b03869295f9f7d3e0e471807fcc6bfd2.webm?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/b03869295f9f7d3e0e471807fcc6bfd2.mp4?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/647066ae92e1ea7d75a5b008810a5d21.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=68 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare <i>Challenge Sculptures</i>, which will introduce you to new techniques and help sharpen your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/4e9706ca2068a9e1fba9c30136033e8d.poster.avif?t=1755116851\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/4e9706ca2068a9e1fba9c30136033e8d.webm?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/4e9706ca2068a9e1fba9c30136033e8d.mp4?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/ad3e1c58efb7430871c36a7a5eb9f9e1.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to figure drawing? The <i>Simplified Form</i> and <i>Perspective Grid</i> tools have you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/a61f9acfbbfbe5d3c7d4ee51f62800fc.poster.avif?t=1755116851\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/a61f9acfbbfbe5d3c7d4ee51f62800fc.webm?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/a61f9acfbbfbe5d3c7d4ee51f62800fc.mp4?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/a4346bbd11fcc34b44902fc83e428612.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through its\u00a0tranquil environment and optional\u00a0<i>Soundscapes</i>, Figure Drawing Garden is designed to help you\u00a0reach a state of flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/8f9bc4f07e32f3e0efc21801bd986e13.poster.avif?t=1755116851\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/8f9bc4f07e32f3e0efc21801bd986e13.webm?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/8f9bc4f07e32f3e0efc21801bd986e13.mp4?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/158eeb2083825e0cd02b932cd79f2f27.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan sculptures\u2019 QR codes to share your drawings to the <i>Community Gallery</i> and see other artists practicing\u00a0alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/22c5e7c8b4a89e45a5d51c5319078e48.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your garden and draw anything you can imagine \u2014 anime, fantasy, sci-fi, and more \u2014 with community-made <i>Model Packs</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/90cc83678fb1f6670c6d4e73edfc4e37.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw together on  Discord! (Link in sidebar or scan QR above)\u00a0\u2014 Share your art, exchange feedback, and help shape the game\u2019s future. Be the first to hear about updates, new model packs, and upcoming events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/8f9bc4f07e32f3e0efc21801bd986e13.poster.avif?t=1755116851\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/8f9bc4f07e32f3e0efc21801bd986e13.webm?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/8f9bc4f07e32f3e0efc21801bd986e13.mp4?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure Drawing Garden is an immersive virtual garden designed to help you practice and improve at figure drawing \u2014 an essential skill for any artist which trains the ability to capture gesture, anatomy, weight, balance, tension, and emotion. So\u00a0grab your sketchbook, relax, explore, and draw in your very own Figure Drawing Garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/74fc98883cdc2e463248f273ba24d8f4.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=68 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exquisite collection of 3D-scanned classical and renaissance sculptures to draw \u2014 curated to provide accurate anatomy, dynamic poses, and a variety of body types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/59ebc82e29e7093bb4ed74bcb52d5c6a.poster.avif?t=1755116851\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/59ebc82e29e7093bb4ed74bcb52d5c6a.webm?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/59ebc82e29e7093bb4ed74bcb52d5c6a.mp4?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/2e510d4c26abe9f287ff5f326ba8af3a.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=68 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your own infinite virtual garden of towering monuments, intricate fountains, and quiet courtyards \u2014 which expands as you draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/fdecbf598bd45f605fa97dd7985f2abe.poster.avif?t=1755116851\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/fdecbf598bd45f605fa97dd7985f2abe.webm?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/fdecbf598bd45f605fa97dd7985f2abe.mp4?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/05239d6bfb95d251867f580a903403af.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practicing your shading?\u00a0Enter <i>Dynamic Lighting</i> mode and light the figure as you desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/b03869295f9f7d3e0e471807fcc6bfd2.poster.avif?t=1755116851\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/b03869295f9f7d3e0e471807fcc6bfd2.webm?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/b03869295f9f7d3e0e471807fcc6bfd2.mp4?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/647066ae92e1ea7d75a5b008810a5d21.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=68 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare <i>Challenge Sculptures</i>, which will introduce you to new techniques and help sharpen your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/4e9706ca2068a9e1fba9c30136033e8d.poster.avif?t=1755116851\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/4e9706ca2068a9e1fba9c30136033e8d.webm?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/4e9706ca2068a9e1fba9c30136033e8d.mp4?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/ad3e1c58efb7430871c36a7a5eb9f9e1.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to figure drawing? The <i>Simplified Form</i> and <i>Perspective Grid</i> tools have you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/a61f9acfbbfbe5d3c7d4ee51f62800fc.poster.avif?t=1755116851\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/a61f9acfbbfbe5d3c7d4ee51f62800fc.webm?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/a61f9acfbbfbe5d3c7d4ee51f62800fc.mp4?t=1755116851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/a4346bbd11fcc34b44902fc83e428612.avif?t=1755116851\" width=1232 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through its\u00a0tranquil environment and optional\u00a0<i>Soundscapes</i>, Figure Drawing Garden is designed to help you\u00a0reach a state of flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594620/extras/8f9bc4f07e32f3e0efc21801bd986e13.poster.avif?t=1755116851\" width=616 